    "value": "This page documents the confirmed delivery methods available per storefront for the Zimmermann SFCC migration. Delivery methods are confirmed and will be configured in SFCC Business Manager per storefront. Shipping costs and free shipping thresholds are indicative at this stage and may be subject to change — all values are configurable in Business Manager without a code deployment.\n\nFor configuration stories see SFCC-832 (Default Shipping Method & Delivery Method BM Configuration) and SFCC-839 (Free Shipping Threshold BM Configuration).\n\n| **Region** | **Website** | **Shipping Method** | **Cost Below Threshold** | **Cost Above Threshold** | **Free Shipping Threshold** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **AU** | **AU website** | DHL Express | $15.00 | Free | $750 |\n| AU | AU website | Next Day | $30.00 | $30.00 | — |\n| AU | AU website | Same Day | $35.00 | $35.00 | — |\n| **AU INT** | AU website (International) | DHL Express International | $30.00 | Free to NZ / $30 to other countries | $750 |\n| **US** | **US website** | FedEx Ground | $15.00 | Free | $850 |\n| US | US website | FedEx Express | $20.00 | Free | $1,200 |\n| US | US website | FedEx Next Day | $30.00 | $30.00 | — |\n| US | US website | Same Day | $45.00 | $45.00 | — |\n| **UK** | **UK website** | DHL Express | £10.00 | Free | £750 |\n| UK | UK website | DHL Next Day (9am, 12pm) | £20.00 | £20.00 | — |\n| UK | UK website | Same Day | £25.00 | £25.00 | — |\n| **EU** | **EU website** | DHL Ground (Economy) | €15.00 | Free | €750 |\n| EU | EU website | DHL Express | €20.00 | Free | €1,000 |\n| EU | EU website | DHL Next Day (9am, 12pm) | €25.00 | €25.00 | — |\n| EU | EU website | Same Day | €35.00 | €35.00 | — |"
  }
