{"result":"{
  "metadata": {
    "id": "258801666",
    "title": "04.2 Design Tracker",
    "type": "page",
    "created": "",
    "updated": "",
    "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/258801666",
    "space": {
      "key": "SFCC",
      "name": "Adobe SFCC"
    },
    "version": 44,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "This page tracks design deliverables required from the design team based on approved business and functional requirements. Phase 1 designs are mostly done by now (June). Phase 2 designs are work in progress and planned to be done by mid-July 2026. We will update **Design Status**, **Accenture Review**, and **Zimmermann Sign-off** in our weekly meetings with the design team.\n\n**How to use this tracker**  \nThis table is organized by functional area where priority is mostly based on the build order. We will add final designs through Figma links in the **Figma Link** column as designs are available, and capture unresolved questions, dependencies, or missing states in **Notes / Open Items**.\n\n| **Prio** | **Epic** | **Component** | **Component Detail** | **Sprint** | **Figma Link** | **Design Status** | **Zimmermann Sign-off** | **Accenture Notes / Open Items** | **Zimmermann Feedback** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Images** | Thumbnails, hero image, flatlay/model/video (incl. Vimeo support) | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | DONEGreen | SIGNED OFFGreen |  | **25-06:** mostly lead with video but option to change that. video, flatlay, then 2-4 images (want to AB test # of images) would like to see design with 4 below the 2 big ones  **30-06:** # of large versus smaller pictures needs to be flexible - needs to work for the product (e.g. runway product may need more images) - logic depends on the # of pictures we have - combination of close ups and zoomed out. Runway has certain logic - and perhaps category on top of that. Pause button on videos |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Image Gallery** | When customer clicks to view more images | Sprint 1-2 |  